      "id": 493841,
      "username": "Nagesh_A_S",
      "name": "Nagesh A S",
      "created_at": "2026-02-10T00:49:46.171Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li><strong>File modified:</strong> <code>apps/frappe/frappe/utils/data.py</code></li>\n<li><strong>Function modified:</strong> <code>orjson_dumps</code></li>\n<li><strong>The Fix:</strong> You wrapped the <code>orjson.dumps</code> call in a <code>try...except</code> block.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>def orjson_dumps(obj, default=None, option=None):<br>\ntry:</p>\n<h1><a name=\"p-493841-try-the-fast-way-first-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493841-try-the-fast-way-first-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Try the fast way first</h1>\n<p>return orjson.dumps(obj, default=default, option=option).decode()<br>\nexcept (TypeError, OverflowError):</p>\n<h1><a name=\"p-493841-fallback-to-standard-json-for-large-integers-or-complex-objects-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493841-fallback-to-standard-json-for-large-integers-or-complex-objects-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Fallback to standard json for large integers or complex objects</h1>\n<p>import json<br>\nreturn json.dumps(obj, default=default, sort_keys=True)</p>",
